{"id":"656311","name":"温拌菠菜虾仁花生米","author":"五加五左左","authorId":"11514294","desc":"","cover":"images/656311/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"虾仁","amount":"300g"}],"sub":[{"name":"菠菜","amount":"100g"},{"name":"花生米","amount":"100g"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"5-6颗"},{"name":"魔芋粉丝","amount":"4-5颗"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"1个"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"虾扒皮成虾仁，切段。","img":"images/656311/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"抓胡椒粉料酒腌一下。","img":"images/656311/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"开水焯熟虾仁丁。","img":"images/656311/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"菠菜洗净热水焯熟。","img":"images/656311/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"晾凉切段。","img":"images/656311/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"魔芋粉丝焯熟。","img":"images/656311/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"虾仁，花生米，菠菜，粉丝，泡在一起。","img":"images/656311/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"蒜末小米辣下油锅炒一下。","img":"images/656311/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"加一勺酱油，一勺蚝油，一勺糖，拌匀倒入食材。","img":"images/656311/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/656311/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}